  name "Class D MPE"
  statement "For Class D load cells, the maximum permissible error shall not exceed: 0 ≤ L < 50v: 0.5 × p_LC 50 ≤ L < 200v: 1.0 × p_LC L ≥ 200v: 1.5 × p_LC"
